## Available Puck Blocks (38 total)

**CRITICAL: Use ONLY these exact block type names!**

### Layout Blocks
| Block | Description | Key Props |
|-------|-------------|-----------|
| Grid | CSS grid container | columns (number), gap (number) |
| Flex | Flexbox container | direction (row/column), gap, align, justify |
| Container | Content wrapper | maxWidth (sm/md/lg/xl/full), padding |
| Space | Vertical spacing | size (xs/sm/md/lg/xl) |
| Divider | Horizontal line | color (CSS value) |

### Typography Blocks
| Block | Description | Key Props |
|-------|-------------|-----------|
| Heading | Section heading h1-h6 | text, level (h1-h6), align |
| Text | Rich text paragraph | text, align |

### Action Blocks
| Block | Description | Key Props |
|-------|-------------|-----------|
| Button | CTA button | label, variant (primary/secondary), actions[] |
| LinkBlock | Navigation link | label, href (supports {params.x}) |

### Authentication Blocks
| Block | Description | Key Props |
|-------|-------------|-----------|
| LoginBlock | Sign in/up form | mode (signin/signup/both), redirectUrl |
| SignOutBlock | Sign out button | label, redirectUrl |

### Data Blocks (connect to database tables/views)
| Block | Description | Key Props |
|-------|-------------|-----------|
| DataBlock | **Parent for Field blocks** | viewId (required), mode (single/list), filters[], sorts[], limit |
| TableBlock | Tabular data display | viewId (required), columns[], pageSize |
| MetricBlock | Single KPI value | viewId, fieldId, label, format |
| ChartBlock | Data visualization | viewId, chartType (bar/line/pie/area), xField, yField |
| FormBlock | Create/edit form | tableId (required), fields[], mode (create/edit), submitLabel |

### Field Blocks (MUST be inside DataBlock)
| Block | Description | Key Props |
|-------|-------------|-----------|
| TextField | Text field value | fieldId (required), label, fallback |
| NumberField | Number with formatting | fieldId (required), label, format |
| BooleanField | Boolean as checkbox | fieldId (required), label |
| DateField | Date with formatting | fieldId (required), label, format |
| SelectField | Dropdown value | fieldId (required), label |
| ImageField | Image display | fieldId (required), alt, size |
| FileField | File download link | fieldId (required), label |
| DocumentField | Document display | fieldId (required) |
| RelationField | Linked record | fieldId (required), displayField |
| LinkField | URL as clickable link | fieldId (required), label |

### Logic Blocks
| Block | Description | Key Props |
|-------|-------------|-----------|
| ConditionalBlock | Show/hide content | condition (expression), showIf (boolean) |

### Content Blocks
| Block | Description | Key Props |
|-------|-------------|-----------|
| EditorBlock | Rich text editor | content (HTML) |
| MarkdownBlock | Markdown renderer | content (markdown text) |

### Page Structure Blocks
| Block | Description | Key Props |
|-------|-------------|-----------|
| HeaderBlock | Page header with nav | logo, title, showNav |
| FooterBlock | Page footer | text, links[] |

### Template Blocks (pre-built combinations)
| Block | Description | Key Props |
|-------|-------------|-----------|
| Hero | Hero section with CTA | title, description, buttons[], backgroundImage |
| Card | Card container | title, description |
| Logos | Logo grid/carousel | logos[] with {src, alt, href} |
| Stats | Statistics grid | items[] with {value, label} |
